Print the JSON Schema (draft-07) of berth.toml, for editors to complete and
check it with. It is generated from the same definitions that validate the file,
but it cannot state every check: `berth config validate` makes the rest. It
needs no berth.toml.

Usage:
  berth config schema [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for schema

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to berth.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -V, --version         output the version number
